# No id column; two rows despawn, so the stored id 5 sits AT OR BEYOND the new row count
# of 4 — a positional gather is a hard index fault, never a mask clear. The hidden
# fixture-row column resolves it to the survivor's new slot instead.
n 6
col cursed bool 1 1 0 0 0 0
rel mentor -1 -1 5 -1 2 -1
col dead bool 0 0 0 0 0 1
col nord bool 1 1 1 1 1 1
col trained bool 1 1 1 1 1 1
ja 呪 cursed
ja 師匠 mentor
ja 死 dead
ja 北 nord
ja 訓練 trained
